ing and start delivering.\n\n...\nHow do you get the best out of AI systems when every token in the context window matters? In this talk I break down context engineering - the art and science of filling an AI's limited memory with the right mix of instructions, data, and history so it can perform at its best.\n\nYou'll learn:\n\nWhat tokens and context windows really are, and why they matter ￼\nWhy prompt engineering often fails without strong context management ￼\nPractical strategies to avoid vague, hallucinated, or poisoned responses ￼\nPatterns for context management - Write, Select, Compress, Isolate\nHow modern AI tools like Cursor and Cline optimize context automatically ￼\nActionable tips for AI-assisted coding: from error logs and design docs to database schemas and PR feedback ￼\n\nWhether you’re building with coding agents, debugging with AI, or designing smarter prompts, this talk will help you make every token count.\n\n#ai #aiengineering #promptengineering #programming #softwareengineering #cursor #cursorai #aicoding #vibecoding #vibecoder #aiassisted #contextwindow #aishorts #aiproductivity","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1113,"length":3,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CDsQ3NcEGCwiEwjW7P7Wh7qXAxWeeMIBHdX8CDfKAQSqxdy1","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/ai","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUGCgJhaRgB"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CDsQ3NcEGCwiEwjW7P7Wh7qXAxWeeMIBHdX8CDc="}},{"startIndex":1117,"length":14,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CDoQ3NcEGC0iEwjW7P7Wh7qXAxWeeMIBHdX8CDfKAQSqxdy1","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/aiengineering","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gURCg1haWVuZ2luZWVyaW5nGAE%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CDoQ3NcEGC0iEwjW7P7